<!--
    Friends and rankings: friends, the weekly leaderboards, the weekly tournament and clubs
    (social/SocialController.kt; the screens in ui/social/). Keys start with social_. Player and
    club names are never translated: club names are made from fixed English words so every member
    sees the same name, and strangers' names on the boards come from their player id.
-->
